t).\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis formula holds where $\\cos x\\ne0$.\n\nThe factor blank is $-2\\sec\\left(x\\right)\\tan\\left(x\\right)$; each argument blank is $\\sec\\left(x\\right)$." #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730727 #edb/ref 1080 "-\\sin\\left(x\\right)\\cdot \\cos\\left(\\cos\\left(x\\right)\\right)" #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730727 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730727 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "284d33c7-53f3-5280-8e4a-4136de1a53c1" #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730728 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186730749 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730728 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730728 #edb/ref 1077 "field-2" #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730728 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186730749 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730728 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "2befeb87-8ea6-5378-9fa4-d12a7017d774" #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730729 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186730733 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730729 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186730752 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730729 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730729 #edb/ref 1071 "Given that $y=6\\sec\\left(\\csc\\left(x\\right)\\right)$, complete the derivative using expressions in $x$. Put the unchanged inner function in each argument blank.\n\n$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}y}{\\mathrm{d}x}=$ {{field-1}} $\\cdot \\sec(\\csc(x))\\cdot\\tan($ {{field-2}} $)$." #edb/ref 13194139543413 #edb/ref 17592186045443 true] [#edb/ref 17592186730729 